ase ordinals; all five children must be Idle at activation.\"},\"egressState(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Stored physical gons, native basis, latent surplus, R0/R1/R2 and executable native cap. spendability. Protected custody accounts have zero public maxUnstake and no wallet surplus.\"},\"deferredRewardGons(uint8,address)\":{\"notice\":\"Exact attributed beneficiary gons in domain 0, 1 or 2; excludes tokenized E and self-held U.\"},\"tokenizedSyRewardGons()\":{\"notice\":\"E = 1e18 * RT.totalSupply(), already physically held by receipt escrow.\"},\"checkpointRewards()\":{\"notice\":\"Synchronize then move the caller's existing wallet surplus into R0 under receipt custody.\"},\"fundRewards(uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"DETF-only settlement hook; pulls and distributes actually funded DETF once.\"},\"retireEscrowDust(uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Bond-vault-only retirement of a closed position's sub-native gons remainder.\"},\"claimDeferredRewards(uint8)\":{\"notice\":\"Activated native-sDETF release of caller's R0 or R1, debiting only paid*k.\"},\"claimDeferredRoleRewards(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Anyone may trigger activated R1 release, but only to the recorded beneficiary.\"},\"transferDeferredRewardRights(uint8,address,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Actual owner assigns exact R0 or R2 rights; no native allowance, mint or custody movement.\"},\"deliverBondClaim(address,uint256,uint256,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Fixed bond-only delivery after position/aggregate debit, checked against actual remaining gons.\"},\"deferSyRewards(address,uint256,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Fixed staking-SY-only checkpoint after debiting its authoritative backingGons.\"},\"transferSyPrincipal(address,uint256,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Fixed staking-SY-only transfer of principal_*k actual gons and principal_ native basis.\"},\"withdrawSyPrincipal(address,uint256,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Fixed staking-SY-only burn of principal_*k and payment of principal_ held DETF.\"},\"issueSyRewardTokens(address,uint256)\":{\"noti